        "original_id": "ce137e3f-8462-52ff-8ec8-c3029b647295",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dean Jones, John Indi, Laurens van der Post\n- Films: The Million Dollar Duck, The $1,000,000 Duck, A Far Off Place, The Love Bug, Beethoven, Incident at Victoria Falls, Mandela\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n- Works: A Far-Off Place, A Story Like the Wind\n- Concepts: golden eggs scenario\n\nFacts:\n- The Million Dollar Duck, also titled The $1,000,000 Duck, is a 1971 American comedy film produced by Walt Disney Productions about a goose that lays golden eggs.\n- Dean Jones played Albert Dooley in The Million Dollar Duck in 1971, and that role received him a Golden Globe nomination.\n- Laurens van der Post wrote A Story Like the Wind in 1972.\n- Laurens van der Post wrote A Far-Off Place in 1974.\n- A Far Off Place is a 1993 American adventure drama film based on Laurens van der Post's works A Far-Off Place and its prequel A Story Like the Wind.\n- John Indi is an actor known for roles in Incident at Victoria Falls in 1992, A Far Off Place in 1993, and Mandela.\n- Dean Jones played Jim Douglas in The Love Bug in 1968 and Dr. Herman Varnick in Beethoven in 1992.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "7f88a6ae-a7d2-5361-b6cc-b230a54dfb7d",
        "text": "Page: The Million Dollar Duck. Sentence: The Million Dollar Duck (also titled as The $1,000,000 Duck) is a 1971 American comedy film produced by Walt Disney Productions about a goose that lays golden eggs scenario.\nPage: A Far Off Place. Sentence: A Far Off Place is a 1993 American adventure drama film based on Laurens van der Post's works \"A Far-Off Place\" (1974) and its prequel \"A Story Like the Wind\" (1972).\nPage: Dean Jones (actor). Sentence: \" (1965), Jim Douglas in \"The Love Bug\" (1968), Albert Dooley in \"The Million Dollar Duck\" (1971; for which he received a Golden Globe nomination) and Dr. Herman Varnick in \"Beethoven\" (1992).\nPage: John Indi. Sentence: John Indi is an actor known for his roles in \"A Far Off Place\" (1993), \"Mandela\", and \"Incident at Victoria Falls\" (1992).",
